      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -608,
        -128
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Validate and route authenticated order webhooks to a sub-workflow\n\n### How it works\n\n1. Receives the order on a webhook protected by Header Auth, so a request without the shared secret is answered with 401 by n8n itself and never starts the workflow.\n2. Checks with an IF node that the fields the rest of the flow depends on are actually present in the payload.\n3. Passes complete payloads to a separate processing sub-workflow, which keeps the webhook execution short so the provider does not time out.\n4. Answers a valid request with 200 and a rejected payload with 400, so the caller can tell the two apart.\n\n### Setup steps\n\n- [ ] Create a Header Auth credential with the header name and secret your provider sends, and attach it to the webhook node.\n- [ ] Point the sub-workflow node at your own order processing workflow.\n- [ ] Edit the IF conditions to match the fields your payload actually contains.\n- [ ] Copy the production webhook URL into your provider's webhook settings.\n\n### Customization\n\nAdd a condition to the IF node for every field you must have. If you expect traffic spikes, insert a queue write before the sub-workflow call so the webhook returns immediately and the work drains separately.",
        "height": 880,
        "width": 480
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "g0",
      "name": "Sticky Note g0",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -48,
        -32
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Receive authenticated webhook\n\nHeader Auth guards the endpoint, so unauthenticated calls are rejected by n8n before any node runs.",
        "height": 384,
        "width": 240,
        "color": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "g1",
      "name": "Sticky Note g1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        848,
        -128
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Validate required fields\n\nRejects a payload that changed shape upstream here, instead of failing halfway through the sub-workflow.",
        "height": 384,
        "width": 240,
        "color": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "g2",
      "name": "Sticky Note g2",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1296,
        -128
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Process order and respond\n\nThe heavy work runs in a separate workflow. Both paths end in an explicit response so the caller knows what happened.",
        "height": 480,
        "width": 640,
        "color": 7
      }
    },
    {
